--Package: mombf
--Type: Package
--Version: 3.5.4.9000
--Date: 2026-10-31
--Title: Bespoke, Stripped-Down mombf Core for BISAM
--Author: David Rossell, John D. Cook, Donatello Telesca, P. Roebuck, Oriol Abril, Miquel Torrens
--    (original mombf 3.5.4); BISAM adaptations by Lucas D. Konrad
--Maintainer: Lucas D. Konrad <lucas.konrad@wu.ac.at>
--Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
--Imports: Rcpp (>= 0.12.16)
--LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppArmadillo
--Description: The subset of mombf 3.5.4 (Rossell et al.) needed by BISAM: Gibbs sampling
--    of break-inclusion indicators with ALA integrated likelihoods under product MOM / iMOM
--    priors with known residual variance, non-local posterior draws of the break sizes, and
--    the prior-elicitation helpers (priorp2g, pmom, pimom, ...). The iMOM posterior-mode
--    solver is a faster exact re-implementation of mombf's; random numbers use R's RNG.
--    For the full functionality use mombf from CRAN.
--License: GPL (>= 2) | file LICENSE
--URL: https://github.com/davidrusi/mombf
--NeedsCompilation: yes
