-Package: bisamcore
-Type: Package
-Version: 0.1.0
-Date: 2026-11-05
-Title: Compiled Core of BISAM (Derived from mombf 3.5.4)
-Author: Lucas D. Konrad (BISAM adaptations); based on mombf 3.5.4 by David Rossell,
-    John D. Cook, Donatello Telesca, P. Roebuck, Oriol Abril, Miquel Torrens
-Maintainer: Lucas D. Konrad <lucas.konrad@wu.ac.at>
-Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
-Imports: Rcpp (>= 0.12.16)
-LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppArmadillo
-Description: Compiled routines used by estimate_bisam() in the BISAM repository: Gibbs
-    sampling of break-inclusion indicators with ALA (or Laplace) integrated likelihoods under
-    product MOM / iMOM priors with known residual variance, non-local posterior draws of the
-    break sizes, and prior-elicitation helpers (priorp2g, pmom, pimom, ...). Derived from
-    mombf 3.5.4 (Rossell et al., <https://github.com/davidrusi/mombf>): only the parts
-    needed by BISAM are kept, re-implemented for speed, and extended (near-global iMOM
-    posterior mode, R's RNG). Not a version of mombf; for mombf use the CRAN package.
-License: GPL (>= 2) | file LICENSE
-NeedsCompilation: yes
